          {
            "start_ref": "quick_turn__002.subtitle.0.start",
            "end_ref": "quick_turn__002.subtitle.0.end",
            "text": "自己的回合，需要从三种行动中选一种：拿宝石、"
          },
          {
            "start_ref": "quick_turn__002.subtitle.1.start",
            "end_ref": "quick_turn__002.subtitle.1.end",
